  "Embedded NUL (\\x00): insertable via parameter binding, fully preserved (length('a\\x00b')=3, strlen=3), treated as an ordinary byte: levenshtein('a\\x00b','ab')=1, hamming('a\\x00b','axb')=1, jaccard('a\\x00b','\\x00')=1/3.",
